  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>q</mi></math> has truth value false only when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math>&nbsp;is true &amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;is false. Hence, truth value of<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi></math>&nbsp;is true.<br /><br />Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></math> is false only when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></math> &amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>both are false.</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;are both&nbsp;true.</p></blockquote>",
